      "source_url": "https://shop.example.com/policies/shipping",
      "content": "Content extracted from https://shop.example.com/policies/shipping:\nStandard return policy allows customers 30 days from delivery to request a refund or exchange. Items must be in original unworn condition with tags attached. Domestic shipping takes 2-4 business days via FedEx Express. Free delivery on all orders over $75. International shipping delivers within 7-10 business days. For cancellations, customers can modify orders within 2 hours of checkout.",
